@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:的确，这里看上去<br>也不是什么正经的地方。|#0205Trial15_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但是……<br>尽管如此，<br>我们真的有必要<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_01\">回去</link>吗……？|#0205Trial15_AnAn002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"在这里，就算能使用魔法<br>也不会引来异样的目光，<br>另外也没有麻烦的<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_02\">人际关系</link>……|#0205Trial15_AnAn003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……说不定，<br>在这里生活<br>反而更<link=\"Objection_02_05_15_03\">轻松</link>。|#0205Trial15_AnAn004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"所以吾辈<br>并<link=\"Objection_02_05_15_04\">没有意愿</link><br>离开这里。|#0205Trial15_AnAn005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你说要【拯救我们】？|#0205Trial15_AnAn006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你自作主张地<br>想帮吾辈……<br>只会让吾辈感到困扰！|#0205Trial15_AnAn007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

